  "workflowCode": "ORA_FAMILY_PRODUCT_SELECTOR",
  "name": "Family/Product Selector",
  "description": "In parallel queries lookup services for families and product lists across multiple families (FIN, PRC, HCM, CX, SCM). It consolidates results into variables, then runs an LLM that, given the input message and the lists, selects the best matching family (excluding COMMON) and suggests a product LookupCode that belongs to that family (or 'Other' when no appropriate product exists).",
