              "id": "1765580974112_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Variables:\nInput Message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nList of Families: {{$context.$variables.families}}\nList of SCM Products: {{$context.$variables.scm}}\nList of HCM Products: {{$context.$variables.hcm}}\nList of PRC Products: {{$context.$variables.prc}}\nList of CX Products: {{$context.$variables.cx}}\nList of FIN Products: {{$context.$variables.fin}}\n\nOutput the below JSON:\n{\n  \"family\": Excluding “COMMON”, best match from 'List of Families' based on input message\n  \"product\": suggest a LookupCode based on the on input message. If Family is \"HCM\", pick a appropriate product from \"List of HCM Products\" or \"Other\".  If Family is \"SCM\", pick a appropriate product from \"List of SCM Products\" or \"Other\".  If Family is \"PRC\", pick a appropriate product from \"List of PRC Products\" or \"Other\".   If Family is \"CX\", pick a appropriate product from \"List of CX Products\" or \"Other\".    If Family is \"FIN\", pick a appropriate product from \"List of FIN Products\" or \"Other\".   Always suggest a product that belongs to Family suggested. If there is not appropriate product for the family suggest \"Other\" as value.,\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
